Package: thinkthen
Type: Package
Title: The ThinkThen Verbs for R
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ian", "Maurer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "imaurer@gmail.com")
Description: The eight verbs (decide, choose, score, tag, filter, rank,
    find, annotate) plus recognize and relate, with a tt_ prefix, over the
    thinkthen Rust library. A column goes in and a column comes out. NA is
    "not sure". A bulk call crosses into the engine once and runs at the
    engine's throttle. Errors carry one of six kinds and a retry signal.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://thinkthen.dev, https://github.com/botassembly/thinkthen
BugReports: https://github.com/botassembly/thinkthen/issues
OS_type: unix
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    jsonlite (>= 2.0.0)
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    dbplyr,
    purrr,
    tidyr,
    igraph
Config/rextendr:
    version = 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
